  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The scrollbar position between the different friendlist representations / favourite friends lists is kept the same.\nThis leads to a really unstatisfying UX experience where when i scroll through my \"Online Friends\" first, then swap to a favourites list i am all the way at the bottom of the list and have to scroll up to see my online friends.\nThe change i am proposing is to either keep a sperate scrollbar position for each friends list or to reset the position to zero when swapping to a different list.",
